# The update test's automatic update with the real RAUC (ota-test
# install-auto): on Wi-Fi (the emulator's simulated access point) the user
# marked metered nothing downloads; marked not metered, the shell installs
# in the background and posts its notification.

== 系统更新：自动更新（真的 RAUC）：计费的 Wi-Fi 上不下载，改成不计费后在后台装好并通知
power 82
wifi-ap Kario-Test kario-5678
wifi-join Kario-Test kario-5678 60000
type /
type 设置
key enter
at root 30000
type /
type Wi-Fi
key enter
key enter
wait 已连接 · 30000
type /
type Kario-Test
key enter
type m
wait 按流量计费（你的设置） 10000
setting auto_system_update 1
sleep 20000
type m
wait 不按流量计费（你的设置） 10000
timeshift 3601
key f4
key up
at sys.notifs
wait 系统更新已安装 900000
setting auto_system_update 0
